<SiteLayout title="Khmer Expense Manager" description="Planned Kroma Digital app for simple USD and KHR income and expense tracking.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">Kroma Digital App</span><h1>Khmer Expense Manager</h1><p>A simple expense and income tracker designed for everyday use in Cambodia, including both USD and KHR.</p></div></section>
<section class="content"><div class="wrap"><div class="grid"><article class="card"><span class="tag">In planning</span><h2>What it is for</h2><p>Khmer Expense Manager is intended to make everyday money records easier to understand without turning personal or small-business bookkeeping into a complicated accounting system.</p><h3>Planned features</h3><ul><li>USD and KHR transaction records</li><li>Income and expense categories</li><li>Simple account-style tracking for cash and commonly used payment balances</li><li>Clear summaries for daily and monthly review</li><li>Khmer-friendly user experience</li></ul></article><article class="card"><h2>Development status</h2><p>This product is currently in planning and validation. Features, pricing, screenshots, and release timing may change before launch.</p><h3>Privacy</h3><p>When the app enters testing or release, its data practices will be documented on the dedicated app privacy page.</p><a class="btn" href="/privacy/khmer-expense-manager">View app privacy page</a></article></div></div></section>
</SiteLayout>